%% Hopline CLI — discovery, CPace handshake and encrypted transfer between two computers on a LAN.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Sender (hopline send)
  actor R as Receiver (hopline receive 42-amber-river-falcon)

  Note over S: Generates code 42-amber-river-falcon<br/>listens on a random TCP port (code expires after 30 min)
  loop Every second until a receiver is accepted
    S-)R: UDP broadcast :41899 { app: "hopline", nameplate: "42", port }
  end
  Note over R: Matches nameplate "42"<br/>(the words are never sent)

  R->>S: TCP connect
  S->>R: "HOPL" ‖ v2 ‖ senderNonce(16)
  R->>S: "HOPL" ‖ v2 ‖ receiverNonce(16) ‖ Y_r = y_r·G
  S->>R: Y_s = y_s·G
  Note over S,R: G = hash_to_curve(code ‖ nonces) on ristretto255 (CPace)<br/>K = y_s·Y_r = y_r·Y_s → HKDF → session key

  R->>S: 🔒 HELLO (key confirmation)
  alt Wrong code (or an impostor)
    S--xR: can't decrypt → closes. Counts as ONE online guess
    Note over S: Stops after 5 wrong codes.<br/>Junk connections don't count.
  else Right code
    S->>R: 🔒 MANIFEST { files: [{ path, size }], total }
    Note over R: Shows files (warns about programs/hidden files)<br/>"Accept? [Y/n]" (or --yes)
    R->>S: 🔒 ACCEPT (or REJECT)
    loop Each file, in manifest order
      S->>R: 🔒 CHUNK (256 KiB, with backpressure)
      Note over R: Writes to a new hidden temp file (exclusive create)
    end
    S->>R: 🔒 DONE
    Note over R: Moves each file into place without overwriting<br/>(default folder: "Hopline <date>")
    R->>S: 🔒 DONE
  end
